the core engines: geospatial indexing, supply, demand forecasting, matching, ETA, upfront and dynamic pricing, routing and map matching, ride sharing, airport queues;. safety and trust: identity, masked calls, trip sharing, SOS, route-deviation and crash detection, fraud (GPS spoofing,

