Uber built Schemaless, a MySQL-backed append-only store, and later Docstore, and used Cassandra for some workloads.

454
00:36:01.773 --> 00:36:06.232
Its Ringpop library provided consistent hashing for sharded services.

455
00:36:07.582 --> 00:36:08.435
