582
00:44:58.091 --> 00:44:59.093
Geography.

583
00:44:59.373 --> 00:45:00.205
Chosen:

584
00:45:00.485 --> 00:45:01.808
H3 hexagons.

585
00:45:02.088 --> 00:45:03.261
Accepted cost:

586
00:45:03.541 --> 00:45:07.424
Learning curve; exact polygons still needed for legal boundaries.

587
00:45:07.704 --> 00:45:08.899
Location state.

588
00:45:09.179 --> 00:45:10.011
Chosen:

589
00:45:10.291 --> 00:45:11.699
In-memory, ephemeral.

590
00:45:11.979 --> 00:45:13.152
Accepted cost:

591
00:45:13.432 --> 00:45:15.267
Brief rebuild after failover.

592
00:45:15.547 --> 00:45:16.379
Pricing.

593
00:45:16.659 --> 00:45:17.491
Chosen:

594
00:45:17.771 --> 00:45:19.883
Upfront fares with reconciliation.

595
00:45:20.163 --> 00:45:21.336
Accepted cost:

596
00:45:21.616 --> 00:45:25.349
Risk of quote versus actual mismatch; needs dispute rules.

597
00:45:25.629 --> 00:45:26.440
Surge.

598
00:45:26.720 --> 00:45:27.552
Chosen:

599
00:45:27.832 --> 00:45:29.944
Smoothed, capped, experiment-tested.

600
00:45:30.224 --> 00:45:31.397
Accepted cost:

601
00:45:31.677 --> 00:45:33.704
Slower reaction to sudden spikes.

602
00:45:33.984 --> 00:45:34.901
Trip store.

603
00:45:35.181 --> 00:45:36.013
Chosen:

604
00:45:36.293 --> 00:45:38.021
Strong consistency per trip.

605
00:45:38.301 --> 00:45:39.475
Accepted cost:

606
00:45:39.755 --> 00:45:42.251
Higher write latency than eventual stores.

607
00:45:43.601 --> 00:45:44.646
Experiments.

608
00:45:44.926 --> 00:45:45.758
Chosen:

609
00:45:46.038 --> 00:45:47.745
Switchbacks for the marketplace.

610
00:45:48.025 --> 00:45:49.198
